NAME
    touch - create an empty file, or update its modified time

SYNOPSIS
    touch <path>

DESCRIPTION
    Creates <path> as an empty file if it doesn't exist yet, or just updates
    an existing file's last-modified time otherwise - walled to the
    project's own directory tree (see 'cd'). Refuses a path that's already
    a directory.

EXAMPLES
    touch scratch.txt
